            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p><b>Discharge summary</b> 2026-11-16</p><p>Admitted through the emergency department on 9 November 2026 after a fall while visiting his son in Copenhagen. X-ray showed a fracture of the neck of the femur.</p><p>His Swedish patient summary was received before surgery. Because of his penicillin allergy another antibiotic was given, his anticoagulant treatment was taken into account and bleeding prepared for, and the anaesthesia was adapted to his heart failure and emphysema.</p><p>Operated on 10 November 2026. The course after the operation was without complications.</p><p>Discharged on 16 November 2026 in a stable condition. His regular medication - insulin, blood-pressure medication and anticoagulant - continues. Recommended after discharge: rehabilitation of the hip and follow-up by his health centre in Sweden.</p></div>"
            },
